Modifications: rewritten in Python 3 (standard library only) rather than copied.
The list/digest split, the per-section caps and the regex anchors follow the
upstream design. The CHECKPOINT logic is dropped. Structured anchors are added
from the transcript's gitOperation, task and AskUserQuestion records, and every
emitted string is secret-masked. The skill is manual only
(disable-model-invocation) and writes a brief in handoff's shape.

The digest idea came from ryanthedev/herderp via the toolbox. herderp has no
license file, and nothing is taken from it.
